{"id":"vd-b1-the-time-capsule","level":"b1","n":27,"title":{"en":"We Thought Cars Would Fly","vi":"Hồi đó tụi mình tưởng ô tô sẽ bay"},"summary":"Sau lễ mở hộp, Nadia và bạn học cũ Toby ngồi đọc lại những dự đoán năm 2001 — đúng, sai và buồn cười.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-time-capsule","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Time Capsule","vi":"Hộp thời gian"}},"scene":{"background":"campus-gate","props":[]},"cast":{"nadia":{"name":{"en":"Nadia","vi":"Nadia"},"look":"woman","x":540,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#2B1B14","skin":"#C68E6A","skinShade":"#AD7654","outfit":"blouse","top":"#AF7AC5","topShade":"#9B65B4"}},"toby":{"name":{"en":"Toby","vi":"Toby"},"look":"man","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#C49A5A","outfit":"tee","top":"#48C9B0","topShade":"#3AB09A"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"toby","en":"Nadia! I can't believe we're reading our own letters.","vi":"Nadia! Không tin nổi là tụi mình đang đọc thư của chính mình.","ipa":["ˈnædjə","aɪ","kænt","bɪˈliv","wiɹ","ˈɹidɪŋ","ˈaʊɚ","oʊn","ˈlɛtɚz"],"start":0.554,"end":4.454,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,2.122],[2,2.304],[3,2.617],[4,3.02],[5,3.203],[6,3.554],[7,3.749],[8,3.932]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"I know. Back then, 2026 seemed so far away.","vi":"Tớ biết. Hồi đó, năm 2026 có vẻ xa xôi lắm.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","bæk","ðɛn","","simd","soʊ","fɑɹ","əˈweɪ"],"start":5.244,"end":9.544,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,5.244],[1,5.302],[2,6.086],[3,6.424],[4,6.88],[5,7.948],[6,8.377],[7,8.807],[8,9.041]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"Listen to mine. \"In 2026, cars will fly and nobody will go to school.\"","vi":"Nghe thư của tớ nè. \"Năm 2026, ô tô sẽ bay và chẳng ai phải đến trường.\"","ipa":["ˈlɪsən","tu","maɪn","ɪn","","kɑɹz","wɪl","flaɪ","ənd","ˈnoʊˌbɑˌdi","wɪl","ɡoʊ","tu","skul"],"start":10.334,"end":16.234,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,10.334],[1,10.686],[2,10.816],[3,12.237],[5,13.813],[6,14.19],[7,14.334],[8,14.763],[9,14.946],[10,15.336],[11,15.506],[12,15.662],[13,15.766]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Ha! We thought cars would fly by now. Everyone predicted that.","vi":"Ha! Hồi đó tụi mình tưởng giờ này ô tô sẽ bay rồi. Ai cũng dự đoán vậy.","ipa":["hɑ","wi","θɔt","kɑɹz","wʊd","flaɪ","baɪ","naʊ","ˈɛvɹiˌwʌn","pɹɪˈdɪktɪd","ðæt"],"start":17.024,"end":21.194,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,17.024],[1,17.67],[2,17.905],[3,18.152],[4,18.569],[5,18.725],[6,18.959],[7,19.09],[8,19.91],[9,20.457],[10,20.952]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"I was sure about it. I even drew a picture.","vi":"Tớ đã rất chắc chắn đấy. Tớ còn vẽ cả tranh nữa.","ipa":["aɪ","wɑz","ʃʊɹ","əˈbaʊt","ɪt","aɪ","ˈivɪn","dɹu","ə","ˈpɪktʃɚ"],"start":21.984,"end":25.384,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,21.984],[1,22.065],[2,22.248],[3,22.508],[4,22.821],[5,23.942],[6,24.151],[7,24.515],[8,24.763],[9,24.841]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Some predictions were accurate, though. Sam wrote that we'd all have tiny computers.","vi":"Nhưng có những dự đoán chính xác mà. Sam viết là ai cũng sẽ có máy tính tí hon.","ipa":["sʌm","pɹiˈdɪkʃənz","wɝ","ˈækjɚət","ðoʊ","sæm","ɹoʊt","ðæt","wid","ɔl","hæv","ˈtaɪni","kəmˈpjutɚz"],"start":26.174,"end":30.844,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,26.174],[1,26.396],[2,26.982],[3,27.151],[4,27.62],[5,28.351],[6,28.794],[7,29.054],[8,29.236],[9,29.419],[10,29.601],[11,29.77],[12,30.187]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"He was right. What did you write?","vi":"Cậu ấy nói đúng. Còn cậu viết gì?","ipa":["hi","wɑz","ɹaɪt","wʌt","dɪd","ju","ɹaɪt"],"start":31.634,"end":34.134,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,31.634],[1,31.708],[2,31.904],[3,33.273],[4,33.481],[5,33.625],[6,33.755]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"I was going to be a vet and live in a big city with a horse.","vi":"Tớ định làm bác sĩ thú y và sống ở thành phố lớn với một con ngựa.","ipa":["aɪ","wɑz","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","bi","ə","vɛt","ənd","lɪv","ɪn","ə","bɪɡ","ˈsɪti","wɪð","ə","hɔɹs"],"start":34.924,"end":38.174,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,34.924],[1,35.005],[2,35.162],[3,35.37],[4,35.435],[5,35.565],[6,35.656],[7,36.151],[8,36.346],[9,36.542],[10,36.633],[11,36.737],[12,37.063],[13,37.375],[14,37.544],[15,37.61]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"And instead you became a teacher. Here, at our old school!","vi":"Vậy mà cậu lại thành giáo viên. Ngay tại trường cũ của tụi mình!","ipa":["ənd","ˌɪnˈstɛd","ju","bɪˈkeɪm","ə","ˈtitʃɚ","hiɹ","æt","ˈaʊɚ","oʊld","skul"],"start":38.964,"end":43.254,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,38.964],[1,39.071],[2,39.54],[3,39.657],[4,40.022],[5,40.1],[6,41.574],[7,42.172],[8,42.303],[9,42.485],[10,42.719]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"I never imagined that. It turned out that I loved teaching more than animals.","vi":"Tớ chưa bao giờ tưởng tượng ra điều đó. Hoá ra tớ yêu dạy học hơn cả động vật.","ipa":["aɪ","ˈnɛvɚ","ˌɪˈmædʒənd","ðæt","ɪt","tɝnd","aʊt","ðæt","aɪ","lʌvd","ˈtitʃɪŋ","mɔɹ","ðæn","ˈænəməlz"],"start":44.044,"end":48.564,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,44.044],[1,44.098],[2,44.476],[3,44.945],[4,45.689],[5,45.897],[6,46.236],[7,46.457],[8,46.587],[9,46.679],[10,47.147],[11,47.538],[12,47.798],[13,47.955]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"Because of Mr. Holt?","vi":"Vì thầy Holt à?","ipa":["bɪˈkɔz","ʌv","ˈmɪstɚ","hoʊlt"],"start":49.354,"end":50.564,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,49.354],[1,49.68],[2,49.784],[3,50.148]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Mostly, yes. I didn't expect to find his letter in the box.","vi":"Phần lớn là vậy. Tớ không ngờ lại tìm thấy thư của thầy trong hộp.","ipa":["ˈmoʊstli","jɛs","aɪ","ˈdɪdənt","ɪkˈspɛkt","tu","faɪnd","hɪz","ˈlɛtɚ","ɪn","ðə","bɑks"],"start":51.354,"end":55.234,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,51.354],[1,51.729],[2,52.577],[3,52.799],[4,53.046],[5,53.567],[6,53.671],[7,53.996],[8,54.153],[9,54.491],[10,54.595],[11,54.687]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"Neither did I. It was beautiful.","vi":"Tớ cũng vậy. Lá thư thật đẹp.","ipa":["ˈniðɚ","dɪd","aɪ","ɪt","wɑz","ˈbjutəfəl"],"start":56.024,"end":58.874,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,56.024],[1,56.327],[2,56.548],[3,57.826],[4,58.009],[5,58.204]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"So what about you? Were you going to be an astronaut?","vi":"Còn cậu thì sao? Hồi đó cậu định làm phi hành gia à?","ipa":["soʊ","wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ju","wɝ","ju","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","bi","æn","ˈæstɹəˌnɑt"],"start":59.664,"end":62.504,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,59.664],[1,59.987],[2,60.13],[3,60.377],[4,61.148],[5,61.356],[6,61.447],[7,61.642],[8,61.708],[9,61.825],[10,61.916]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"A footballer, actually. Now I sell insurance.","vi":"Thật ra là cầu thủ bóng đá. Giờ tớ bán bảo hiểm.","ipa":["ə","ˈfʊtbɔləɹ","ˈækˌtʃuəli","naʊ","aɪ","sɛl","ˌɪnˈʃʊɹəns"],"start":63.294,"end":67.404,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,63.294],[1,63.349],[2,64.313],[3,65.838],[4,66.177],[5,66.294],[6,66.62]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Well, nobody can predict the future perfectly.","vi":"Thôi thì, chẳng ai dự đoán tương lai hoàn hảo được.","ipa":["wɛl","ˈnoʊˌbɑˌdi","kæn","pɹɪˈdɪkt","ðə","ˈfjutʃɚ","ˈpɝfəktli"],"start":68.194,"end":71.374,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,68.194],[1,69.054],[2,69.535],[3,69.718],[4,70.095],[5,70.212],[6,70.668]]},{"speaker":"toby","en":"True. What will your students predict for 2051?","vi":"Đúng. Học sinh của cậu sẽ dự đoán gì cho năm 2051?","ipa":["tɹu","wʌt","wɪl","jɔɹ","ˈstudənts","pɹɪˈdɪkt","fɔɹ",""],"start":72.164,"end":76.164,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,72.164],[1,73.546],[2,73.807],[3,73.937],[4,74.093],[5,74.549],[6,74.927],[7,75.083]]},{"speaker":"nadia","en":"Flying cars, probably. Some things never change!","vi":"Chắc là ô tô bay. Có những thứ chẳng bao giờ thay đổi!","ipa":["ˈflaɪɪŋ","kɑɹz","ˈpɹɑbəˌbli","sʌm","θɪŋz","ˈnɛvɚ","tʃeɪndʒ"],"start":76.954,"end":80.274,"expression":"happy","react":{"toby":"happy"},"timing":[[0,76.954],[1,77.23],[2,77.712],[3,78.716],[4,79.068],[5,79.328],[6,79.654]]}],"words":[{"id":"predict","en":"predict","ipa":"pɹɪˈdɪkt","vi":"dự đoán; tiên đoán","level":1},{"id":"imagine","en":"imagine","ipa":"ˌɪˈmædʒən","vi":"tưởng tượng; hình dung","level":0},{"id":"expect","en":"expect","ipa":"ɪkˈspɛkt","